WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:05.020
<i>Shark and Rio are on the verge of death after being injected by Kurage's poison.</i>

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:07.980
<i>The only way to save them both is to win the Duel.</i>

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:11.440
<i>Then out of nowhere appeared our former nemesis, IV!</i>

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:14.950
<i>A Tag Duel with Shark and IV has now begun!</i>

00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:20.900
Just what the hell is going on here?!

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:24.670
I know I destroyed his Jellyfish Number!

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:27.090
But they've split into two!

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:29.060
But why?!

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:34.120
I activated the effect of Stealth Kragen the Deadly Poisonous Jellyfish!

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:38.170
When this guy is destroyed, depending on the number of Overlay Units attached to it,

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:42.180
I can Special Summon a "Stealth Kragen" Monster from the Extra Deck or Graveyard,

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:44.850
equal to the number of units attached.

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:48.500
Stealth Kragen has two Overlay Units.

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:52.910
Thus, I Special Summoned two Stealth Kragen Ephyras.

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:55.190
Tch... An effect like that?

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:59.940
And when Stealth Kragen Ephyra is Special Summoned through this effect,

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:04.360
it adds the destroyed Stealth Kragen as its Overlay Units.

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:08.820
And these Stealth Kragen Ephyras have the same effect.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:11.300
You probably don't know this.

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:14.670
But among some Jellyfish there is a higher ranking one that can split in two,

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:18.870
regenerating themselves from the original one.

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:23.250
Another higher class, when it gets too old, can become young again.

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:24.990
And you shouldn't be surprised it.

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:28.020
These Senpai have no hearts or brains or anything like that!

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:31.480
Don't go boasting about not having a brain, you idiot!

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:35.830
Let me ask you one more time!

00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:37.650
The hell do you think you are?!

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:39.560
Little punk!

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:44.740
<i>Still, that jellyfish Monster has a troubling effect...</i>

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:48.130
<i>If I don't hurry up and deplete his Life...!</i>

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:50.990
I activate Giant Killer's effect!

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:53.390
By detaching one Overlay Unit,

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:58.530
I can destroy all other Xyz Monsters 
on the field other than Giant Killer!

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:02.970
Break apart, you jellyfish bastard!

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:08.850
And the opposing player takes damage equal to the total Attack Points of the destroyed Monsters!

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:12.240
Destruction Cannon!

00:02:20.210 --> 00:02:23.990
How's that? I brought his Life Points down by 3800 points.

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:25.830
Big Brother IV!

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:30.420
But I activate Ephyra's effect!

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:35.260
I'll revive Number 4: Stealth Kragen the Deadly Poisonous Jellyfish!

00:02:35.490 --> 00:02:39.380
And I'll Special Summon a third Stealth Kragen Ephyra!

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:46.240
What now?

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:49.650
I'll fill this whole world with jellyfish!

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:54.850
I set one card face-down...and end my turn!

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:58.300
Now no matter how many times they destroy his Monsters,

00:02:58.610 --> 00:02:59.600
they'll come back again!

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:01.070
What'll they do?

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:05.020
<i>I can't allow myself to lose this Duel...!</i>

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:08.660
<i>I'll save Rio no matter what!</i>

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:38.760
<i>Being best friends doesn't mean we always were</i>

00:03:38.760 --> 00:03:41.810
<i>That's pretty much true</i>

00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:49.270
<i>I found you during our serious battles</i>

00:03:49.440 --> 00:03:52.820
<i>The other me inside myself</i>

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:57.700
<i>Awakening from within the conflict</i>

00:03:57.700 --> 00:04:04.040
<i>A turn for a chance! Seize it! Draw!</i>

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:07.250
<i>Duel! Dualism!</i>

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:10.130
<i>These cards are polished to fit each other</i>

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:14.760
<i>My fated opponent is my heart reflected through the mirror</i>

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:17.840
<i>And if we end up with a "tie" in the end,</i>

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:26.310
<i>when we fall, all covered with mud, we'll praise each other</i>

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:46.340
Yuma, Rio-<i>san</i>'s condition keeps getting worse and worse!

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:49.810
The doctors are saying there's nothing they can do!

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:52.180
"Shark and IV's World-Shaking Mayhem!! 
Hell-Shark Tag Team"

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:53.060
Please... Hurry up and save them!

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:54.310
<i>Yuma!</i>

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:56.690
This is bad...

00:04:57.230 --> 00:05:00.820
The two of them might be in trouble before they can finish the match!

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:02.240
Shark...

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:07.240
This is low, Kurage! Fight this match fair and square!

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:15.750
Ryouga! You may be worn out, but your sister's about to die!

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:18.250
That's the one rule here that we can't change!

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:20.920
So the only thing you can do is win!

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:22.920
No matter what the situation!

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:24.970
I don't need anyone to tell me that!

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:29.800
Like hell I'll lose to some jellyfish bastard!

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:30.970
Shark!

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:34.180
<i>But this guy's admittedly formidable...!</i>

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:37.140
<i>There's no telling how long my body will hold out...</i>

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:42.690
<i>And if I destroy those jellyfish Monsters, they'll just keep coming back.</i>

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:47.030
If I don't defeat him and reduce his Life immediately...

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:49.030
<i>If that's the case...</i>

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:56.290
<i>Abyss Splash... Using that Number, maybe...!</i>

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.080
My turn! Draw!

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:04.090
I set a Monster in Face-Down Defense Position!

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:08.550
Face-Down? What's wrong with you, Ryouga?!
 Where'd that vigor from before go?!

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:11.390
You can attack him this turn, you know!

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:14.680
Even if the jellyfish bastard keeps reviving his Monsters,

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:17.730
I'll still keep smashing them with my fist!

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:23.230
What's wrong? Fighting amongst yourselves? How unsightly!

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:27.780
I activate the Continuous Trap, Ebb Tide!

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:33.240
This card, when a player sets a
 Monster in Face-Down Defense Position,

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:35.490
flips it face-up!

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:39.750
And you can't activates its Reverse Effects!

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:43.710
What's this? You gave up on the Water-Attribute and used a Dark-Attribute?

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:47.050
Are you that scared of Stealth Kragen's effect?

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:50.010
Hey, junior, you're pretty simpleminded.

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:52.300
It's frustrating, but he's right.

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:55.680
Just what are you trying to do, Ryouga?!

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:59.560
Shut up...! I end my turn there...!

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:02.900
<i>Tch... I'm starting to lose my vision...</i>

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:05.070
<i>But I have to endure it for now!</i>

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:07.860
<i>Until I get a chance to kick his ass...!</i>

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:11.360
You don't even know when to die, you shark bastard!

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:15.280
My turn! Draw! I'll put you out of your misery!

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:18.540
I activate the Magic Card, Jelly Rain!

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:22.830
All Monsters on the field become Water-Attributes!

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:23.750
What?!

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:28.340
Now your Monsters won't be able to fend off the jellyfishes' poison.

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:34.930
I'll finish you both off!

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:38.020
And I'll start with Tron's stupid son!

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:41.600
I activate the effect of Number 4, Stealth Kragen!

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:45.940
Once per turn, it can destroy one Water-Attribute Monster on the field!

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:50.320
And my opponent takes damage equal to its Attack Power!

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:55.280
Now take Giant Killer's 1500 Attack Points as damage!

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:05.420
And you're next.

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:07.630
Shark fin bastard!

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:10.720
I activate Stealth Kragen Ephyra's effect!

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:16.260
It destroys Skull Kraken and deals you its 600 Attack Points as damage!

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:19.720
Not good! Shark's got 400 Life Points!

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:21.520
If that hits him...!

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:29.730
Trap, activate! Strings Shade!

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:34.450
It negates the effects of all Monsters on the field!

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:38.280
IV, you...!

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:46.960
Tch! Then I'll just battle! Shark fin bastard, I'll rip you a new one!

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:51.300
I use Number 4, Stealth Kragen to attack Skull Kraken!

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:53.420
Tentacle Surge!

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:59.010
This isn't good! Ryouga's field's empty!

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:03.020
Stealth Kragen Ephyra, Direct Attack!

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:04.270
Ryouga!

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:08.360
Trap, activate! Deep Current!

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:13.690
It negates one of the opponent's Direct Attacks and ends the battle!

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:16.820
You're one tenacious bastard.

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:20.660
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:28.170
Ryouga!!

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:29.590
Shark!!

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:32.630
Rio-<i>san</i>...

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:35.840
Yuma, Rio-<i>san</i>'s condition just...!

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:37.380
There's no time!

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:42.390
Shark...! You can do it! Save your sister!

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:47.600
<i>Rio...</i>

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:54.900
<i>My body won't listen to me...</i>

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:56.650
<i>Rio...</i>

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:00.530
<i>So I won't be able to save you?</i>

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:02.280
Shark...

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:03.910
Ryouga...

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:07.710
Why are you falling down so pathetically?!

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:10.130
Hey, you jellyfish bastard!

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:14.210
You're going to get a good taste of my fanservice this time!

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:17.590
My turn! Draw!

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:24.350
When I have 2000 or more Life, I can activate the Magic Card, Gimmick Puppet Ritual!

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:29.020
I can Special Summon one
 Gimmick Puppet Monster from my Graveyard!

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:35.150
Revive, Gimmick Puppet Giant Killer!

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:43.950
Even if you revive that Monster, you can't defeat my Monster!

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:46.410
Don't get ahead of yourself, jellyfish bastard.

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:50.080
By releasing the Xyz Monster on my field,

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:54.210
I can Special Summon Gimmick Puppet Nightmare to the field!

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:59.180
Thanks to this effect, the Special Summoned Nightmare

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:01.590
can be used as two Xyz Materials!

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:04.600
Go, Brother!

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:06.680
IV...

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:12.400
I Overlay the Level Eight Dark-Attribute Gimmick Puppet Nightmare!

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:17.820
I use this Monster treated as two to build the Overlay Unit!

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:19.820
Xyz Summon!

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:24.330
Show yourself, Number 40!

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:33.460
Gimmick Puppet Heaven's Strings!

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:36.880
Heaven's Strings...

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:40.840
He can do it! Heaven's Strings has 3000 Attack Points!

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:42.970
And if he uses its Monster Effect...

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:48.600
No you don't! I activate the Continuous Trap, Jelly Bind!

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:52.440
When I have a Water-Attribute Monster on my field,

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:55.860
I can target one of the opponent's Monsters and activate it!

00:11:57.020 --> 00:11:59.440
I'll target Heaven's Strings!

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:06.450
The targeted Monster can't attack or use its Monster Effects!

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:10.660
What'd you say?!

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:15.130
Now your Monster's truly become a useless puppet.

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:19.550
I set one card face-down and end my turn!

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:24.340
Now then, shark fun bastard! It's your turn! What's wrong?

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:28.470
Oh yeah!

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:31.810
It seems the jellyfish's poison's gone through his entire body.

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:34.020
So he probably can't stand up anymore.

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:36.440
Ryouga!

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:39.150
You're done for!

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:42.400
Jellyfish beats Shark!

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:43.610
Shark!

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:45.660
<i>Ryouga...</i>

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:51.080
I see now! So you're not even a man!

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:55.870
You're a useless older brother that can't even
 save his freakin' lil' sister!

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:57.880
Stand up, Ryouga!

00:12:58.340 --> 00:12:59.960
IV! Why, you...!

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:04.050
How the heck can you say you know
 how Shark feels about his sister?!

00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:05.260
I'm well aware!

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:08.220
I understand completely.

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:10.510
I'm his number one fan, after all...

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:14.520
I'm the one who incriminated him before...

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:18.520
And I'm the guy who ended up hurting his little sister.

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:24.950
Because of that, I'll be carrying these scars on my face for the rest of my life.

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:26.410
So I understand.

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:31.910
He's the kind of guy who fights caring more about what happens to his baby sister rather than to him.

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:33.620
Big Brother IV...

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:36.420
And... It's not just that...

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:41.590
I have to thank him and Yuma for getting in the way.

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:44.590
Thanks to them, I got my family back.

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:47.220
IV... You...

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:49.390
So get up, Ryouga!

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:52.890
You've fought for your family all this time!

00:13:53.770 --> 00:13:58.020
A man like that would never give on his little sister!

00:13:58.600 --> 00:13:59.980
That's who Ryouga is!

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:04.280
STAND UP, RYOUGA!

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:08.200
Really...

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:14.290
I don't know much about you, but you're one helluva nosy guy....

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:16.000
I-Impossible...!

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:19.290
I'm not gonna sit and lie down quietly just yet!

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:22.040
You bastard...!

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:28.550
If that's the case, then let's finish this Duel up so you can take a nap.

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:30.930
h, sure, I'll take you up on that offer.

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:33.430
<i>Rio, I'll make sure to save you.</i>

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:35.810
My turn! Draw!

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:43.190
I activate the Continuous Spell, Amulet of the Water Deity!

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:46.820
Water-Attribute Monsters I control on the field

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:50.490
can't be targeted by my opponent's Magic, Trap, or Monster effects!

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:53.530
A shark never lets its prey get away once it's caught!

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:54.950
Not until it chews it!

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:58.660
I activate the Continuous Spell, Authority of Atlantis, from my hand!

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:05.050
It can raise the levels of all Water-Attribute Monsters Summoned during this turn by two!

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:09.930
And during the turn I activate a normal Magic Card, I can Special Summon this guy from my hand!

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:12.050
Come, Big Jaws!

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:15.890
Using the effect of Authority of Atlantis,

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:20.980
I raise the levels of the Water-Attribute Monsters Summoned during this turn by two!

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:24.480
And then I Summon Panther Shark!

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:28.320
When the opponent has two or more Monsters on their field,

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:30.490
I can Summon it without release!

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:35.370
He's got two Level Fives!

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:36.660
There it is.

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:38.830
Now here goes!

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:43.460
I Overlay the Level Five Big Jaws and Panther Shark!

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:47.710
I use these two Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:49.340
Xyz Summon!

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:53.140
Come out, Number 73!

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:57.260
The holy water drop falling into chaos!

00:15:57.260 --> 00:16:00.850
Show your power and purify all disorder!

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:04.270
Abyss Splash the Roaring Waterfall Deity!

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:09.990
Wh-What is that Monster?!

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:14.820
Number 73... Abyss Splash.

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:18.410
It's the Number I got from those ruins.

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:22.000
Containing my memories...

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:27.000
No, that's not true! I'm...

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:28.960
Ryouga Kamishiro!

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:33.180
Rio, I'll get you back!

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:36.090
IV, let's win!

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:37.220
Yeah!

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:41.730
Stop screwing with me, damn juniors! Why are you getting all excited?!

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:44.730
Trap, activate! Jelly Hole!

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:51.400
It can be activated when the opponent Special Summons a Water-Attribute Xyz Monster!

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:57.280
It binds all face-up cards on the opponent's field during this turn!

00:16:57.780 --> 00:16:59.540
Now the card effects of both Amulet of the Water Deity

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:02.120
and the effects of Abyss Splash are negated!

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:06.330
Now you can't activate effects against your superior!

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:10.050
I activate the effect of No. 4 -  Stealth Kragen the Deadly Poisonous Jellyfish!

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:15.090
It destroys one face-up Water-Attribute on the field once per turn,

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:18.260
and deals the opponent damage equal to its Attack Power!

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:21.270
Smash Abyss Splash apart!

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:24.520
You think so?

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:25.690
What?

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:30.860
I activate the Quick-Play Spell, Cascade Barrier!

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:37.610
It negates a card effect that would destroy a Monster on my field,

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:42.080
and until the end of this turn,

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:45.250
that Monster's Attack Power becomes zero!

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:51.210
Then I'll once again activate Stealth Kragen Ephyra's effect!

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:55.970
Destroy Abyss Splash and deal the opponent damage equal to its Attack Power!

00:17:56.590 --> 00:18:01.810
The damage will be zero, but you'll lose the only Monster you had on the field!

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:09.770
Trap, activate! Angel Strings!

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:15.780
When I have a "Gimmick Puppet" Xyz Monster on my field,

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:20.200
I can Special Summon one Xyz Monster from the Graveyard!

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:27.160
I'll revive Abyss Splash from Ryouga's Graveyard!

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:29.960
My brother and Shark are amazing!

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:31.080
What guys!

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:35.090
And thanks to this effect, Heaven's Strings

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:37.970
will become Abyss Splash's Overlay Unit!

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:42.430
I activate Abyss Splash's effect!

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:48.640
By detaching one Overlay Unit, I can double its Attack Power until the end of the turn!

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:53.900
I then use another Overlay Unit!

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:57.530
Thus, I double its doubled Attack Power!

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:02.030
9600 Attack Points!

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:06.160
Abyss Splash, attack Stealth Kragen!

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:07.790
Go!

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:11.080
Final Fall!!

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:45.530
Both her heart rate and blood pressure have returned to normal.

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:47.910
I don't believe it. The poison was counteracted somehow.

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:50.580
Yuma, Rio-<i>san</i> is...!

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:51.670
Yup!

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:54.840
Shark, your sister's fine!

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:58.300
Man, you really made me work my ass off.

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:02.090
But you got pretty sloppy there for a while, Ryouga.

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:06.720
What'd you say?! You're the one who went and butted in without me asking!

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:09.640
As usual, you're not the least bit charming and you just won't die.

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:12.850
I wonder if they're on good or bad terms.

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:16.310
Astral...

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:18.280
<i>Let's go, Yuma!</i>

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:19.280
<i>Stand up, Yuma!</i>

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:20.900
<i>Your decision was the right one!</i>

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:22.530
<i>Go, Yuma!</i>

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:24.610
Yuma...

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:27.780
Impossible... I can't believe I...

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:30.000
...lost to that shark bastard...

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:36.170
Impossible... you can't be...!

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:42.130
When I botched a job and was being chased by the police...

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:50.220
That kid was in the car I ended up slamming into...

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:59.020
But... that can't be true, can it!?

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:01.230
If it is, then you can't be here.

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:03.070
What the hell are you talking about?

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:06.950
That's right...! I remember now...! Ryouga Kamishiro...

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:15.290
I learned after the accident that
 your entire family, including you, died!

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:17.540
You should be dead! Dead as a doornail!

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:19.840
Hey, stop screwing around!

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:23.760
How... You're supposed to be dead... so how...!?

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:25.380
Hey!

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:29.350
What did he mean...?

00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:38.020
<i>That... That's...</i>

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:43.820
<i>That's the coat of arms I remember seeing from the memory I experienced back at the ruins...</i>

00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:46.490
What's wrong, Ryouga?

00:21:48.110 --> 00:21:53.750
<i>That King's coat of arms and my family's coat of arms are the same!</i>

00:21:54.290 --> 00:21:55.160
Shark...?

00:21:57.540 --> 00:21:58.500
<i>No way...!</i>

00:21:59.920 --> 00:22:00.840
<i>I'm...</i>

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:03.420
<i>...a Barian?</i>

00:22:21.310 --> 00:22:23.820
<i>Is it the world that's boring?</i>

00:22:23.820 --> 00:22:26.360
<i>Or maybe you're the one who's not gettin' serious?</i>

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:27.570
<i>Do you understand?</i>

00:22:27.570 --> 00:22:28.990
<i>Do I understand?</i>

00:22:29.200 --> 00:22:31.870
<i>Already got my answers</i>

00:22:31.910 --> 00:22:34.370
<i>Once you start movin', you ain't stoppin'</i>

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:36.910
<i>I go on thinkin' even while losin'.</i>

00:22:36.910 --> 00:22:38.000
<i>Do you understand?</i>

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:39.040
<i>I understand!</i>

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:42.420
<i>Our formula for reversal's already gathered</i>

00:22:42.420 --> 00:22:44.750
<i>You afraid it ain't comin' true?</i>

00:22:44.750 --> 00:22:47.880
<i>I gotta 'least give it a try</i>

00:22:47.880 --> 00:22:50.090
<i>Ain't no problem if they say I'm borin'</i>

00:22:50.090 --> 00:22:53.100
<i>True failure's when we stop movin'</i>

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:55.060
<i>Come on! Ga, ga, ga, guys & dolls</i>

00:22:55.060 --> 00:22:56.430
<i>Go, go, go, go my way</i>

00:22:56.430 --> 00:22:58.310
<i>Oh, oh, oh, over ray</i>

00:22:58.600 --> 00:23:02.610
<i>Door's always open for you</i>

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:07.690
<i>Bring your power forth and go way, go way</i>

00:23:07.690 --> 00:23:08.950
<i>I understand!</i>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:12.950
<i>And tears are no way, no way</i>

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:18.330
<i>With all my strength, pave way, go way</i>

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:19.540
<i>I understand!</i>

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:23.670
<i>Got all the courage here</i>

00:23:23.670 --> 00:23:25.840
<i>You ought to understand!</i>

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:28.050
<i>Go way, go way</i>

00:23:40.940 --> 00:23:44.560
With memories of the late Astral in our thoughts, we make a memorial shaped like the key.

00:23:44.940 --> 00:23:47.820
Therefore, we aren't focusing on what the enemies are doing.

00:23:48.230 --> 00:23:52.030
Under the surface, that man and the others are working on a secret plan!

00:23:52.740 --> 00:23:54.120
So you truly want him to...?

00:23:54.660 --> 00:23:55.580
You guys...!

00:23:56.240 --> 00:23:59.160
Yuma is the only one who can save Astral!

00:23:59.500 --> 00:24:00.460
That machine...!

00:24:01.410 --> 00:24:03.080
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:24:03.420 --> 00:24:06.000
"The Stern Duelist - Dyson Sphere Upheaval!!"

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:08.670
Now I can go to him!
